.DS_Store
dist/*

# Dev binaries built by the justfile (just build / just dev).
/bin/

# Compiled language output from `just langs` — produced by flatc, capnp and
# thrift, not by this repository, and regenerated on demand. The *schema* under
# examples/generated is committed; the code compiled from it is not.
#
# The directory is named with a leading underscore because the Go tool skips
# such paths, which keeps the generated capnp-go and thrift-go packages, and
# their capnproto.org and apache/thrift dependencies, out of this module's
# `go build ./...`. See examples/buffers.yaml.
/examples/generated/_lang/
